  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Each stem starts with Fact. or Opinion. Never drop that label and never hide the kind in the prompt only.",
      "Four endings. Exactly one finishes the labeled kind. The other three are the other kind and still make a real sentence.",
      "Fact endings can be seen, counted, or checked. Opinion endings judge or feel: best, fun, funny, pretty, tasty, great, yummy, cute.",
      "Never write two endings that both fit the label. Never use nonsense words just to be wrong.",
      "Tier 3 near misses: a fact stem with pretty, best, or fun stuck on a real place, or an opinion stem whose wrong endings are checkable times or places.",
      "Kid world only. No brands. Use <NAME>, never a real name. Every stem and choice word comes from roots.txt or allowed_extra_words."
    ]
  },
