  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Stems of four to six words. Fact. or Opinion. plus a short kid frame. Right endings are obvious: pond, cold, the best, fun. Wrong endings are clearly the other kind.",
    "2": "Stems of five to eight words. Two-syllable words and Grade 2 grammar such as irregular past. Opinion frames may use feels or think. Distractors are checkable or judgment words, not junk.",
    "3": "Stems up to ten words. Near-miss endings that would be right for the other label. One NAME item. Fact stems that look like feelings, or opinion stems that tempt a place or time."
  },
